  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "eeCLOUD 4.2.0 removes the legacy FTP backend and FluentFTP dependency, keeping SFTP as the supported remote file/binary storage engine.\n\nHighlights in this release:\n- Removed FtpEngine and ServerType.Ftp from the public engine selection model.\n- Removed the FluentFTP package dependency.\n- Updated package metadata and README backend lists to reflect PostgreSQL, MySQL, SQL Server, eeCACHE and SFTP support.\n- Updated MySqlConnector to 2.6.0.\n- Hardened UpdateData(field, value, ...) so missing records return a failed Memory result instead of throwing from an empty result set.",
